# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research artifacts (paper/, testbed/) are intentionally NOT part of main —
# see AGENTS.md section 1.3. They live on feat/ai-triage-mainline / research /
# testbed. The rules below only matter if one of those trees is ever checked
# out or merged locally on top of main; they keep build output and generated
# results from being re-added by accident, they do not vendor the trees
# themselves.
#
# research/agents/*.md and research/notes/ are the opposite case: small
# coordination claim-files (see AGENTS.md section 3) meant to be committed on
# main by design, so nothing here excludes research/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# LaTeX / paper build artifacts (research branch)
paper/build/
paper/main.bbl
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.blg
paper/*.out
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.fls
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/*.run.xml
paper/*.pdf
submission.zip

# Experiment orchestration output (testbed branch)
testbed/results/
testbed/analysis/
testbed/.cache/
metrics/

# QLoRA training checkpoints / adapters / tensorboard logs (ai-agent branch).
# Multi-GB, exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file limit, and regenerable via
# run_ai_pipeline.sh -- never commit these regardless of which branch.
runs/

# Local working context (not part of any branch deliverable)
docs_context/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
